Z||000026||1FST2M6||12-21-2000||09:12 AM||||the white one in the first pic is an 87-89 Turbo (non intercooled) the others are Twin Turbo V8s laying down between 320 and 380hp at the wheels! they are all the same motor but being hand built each car is different. We've had a few on the dyno at the shop.. all but one were VERY quiet and STOOOOPID fast. will pull 195mph on the dyno with no problem (the gearing is killer) the loud one was Phillipe Charriol's race car (yeah the watch makers)<p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 12-21-2000).]||||reg||1
